od calls like `client.Organizations.List(ctx, \"willnorris\", nil)`.\n\nThis pattern separates request construction from execution, allowing for flexibility in adding headers, modifying the request before sending, and handling responses consistently across the library."],"durationSeconds":6.060593165999977},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"11ff1211-a166-49b4-8a1a-b4d1957e53c5","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/soph/Work/entire/devenv/cli","sessionId":"4d570a00-2bde-45d9-a871-46c43fdae1d4","version":"2.1.129","gitBranch":"feat/trail-watch-sse"}
